// Extension control and syntax in the editor (§9.1, §4.4): the parsing rule outside the module
// with [[extension(own_only)]] for its entity (here is a record with the word twice in the
// block) - own_only check rejects, error on the rule announcement; its word is the program
// rule, no error.
// program: editor_own.tz
open_view module
// expect: kind="error" text="twice: расширять сущности модуля geo.rules можно только в нём (own_only)
// expect: kind="n_fn" pieces=["syntax twice {body} again => "
// Twicy is the rule of the program block: no error, twice is the write of the module
pointer 1 @syntax 0 12
key 1 Backspace
key 1 y
// expect: kind="n_fn" pieces=["syntax twicy {body} again => "
// expect-not: kind="error"
